INTERVIA — User Stories
US-01 — User Registration
As a new user,
I want to create an account using my name, email and password,
so that I can access the interview platform.
US-02 — User Login
As a registered user,
I want to log into the system,
so that I can access my interview dashboard.
US-03 — Candidate Profile
As a candidate,
I want to select my primary technical skill,
so that the system can generate relevant interview questions.
US-04 — Resume Upload
As a candidate,
I want to upload my resume in PDF or DOCX format,
so that the system can analyze my skills, projects and experience.
US-05 — Resume-Based Interview
As a candidate,
I want interview questions to be generated based on my resume,
so that the interview becomes personalized.
US-06 — Start Interview
As a candidate,
I want to start an AI-powered technical interview,
so that I can practice in a realistic interview environment.
US-07 — Adaptive Questions
As a candidate,
I want the difficulty of questions to adapt according to my performance,
so that the interview evaluates my actual technical ability.
US-08 — Voice Interview
As a candidate,
I want to answer questions using my voice,
so that I can simulate a real interview conversation.
US-09 — AI Evaluation
As a candidate,
I want the AI to evaluate my answers,
so that I can understand how well I performed.
US-10 — Camera Monitoring
As a candidate,
I want to enable my camera during the interview,
so that the interview experience resembles a real online assessment.
US-11 — Timed Interview
As a candidate,
I want each question to have a time limit and the interview to have an overall time limit,
so that I can practice answering under interview pressure.
US-12 — Results
As a candidate,
I want to see my scores after completing the interview,
so that I can measure my performance.
US-13 — Performance Analysis
As a candidate,
I want to see my overall performance percentage,
so that I can identify whether my performance is excellent, good or needs improvement.
US-14 — Interview History
As a candidate,
I want to see my previous interview activity,
so that I can track my progress.

